/// Whole words hyphenated by hand, space-separated, with `-` at each
/// break. One string: tiny per-word arrays would land in RAM on device.
pub(crate) static EXCEPTIONS: &[u8] = b"as-so-ciate as-so-ciates dec-li-na-tion oblig-a-tory phil-an-thropic present presents project projects re-cog-ni-zance reci-procity ref-or-ma-tion ret-ri-bu-tion ta-ble";
